   "derivation": "A secp256k1 signature costs 2800 of FEE-4's verification cost, which FP-6 adds to the prefix's execution gas: 97200 + 2800 = 100000 is max_verify_gas under claim-gated, and 97201 + 2800 is above it. FP-6 runs before CG-2. The senders have code, so their VERIFY frames approve without a signature of their own."
